cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Version 2.1.0, 12 September 2026. Identify the version and informal AI-review status when citing."
title: "A full-variable positivity window for the bamboo-tree weak-rank functional"
authors:
  - name: "Quantyra Research"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "For even n>=1024 and m=n^2, the specified restricted bamboo-tree weak-rank functional is positive on squares of actual X/Y/U polynomials of degree at most floor(n/(32 log_2 n)). The Boolean restricted simple bamboo encoding has no real SoS refutation of raw certificate degree at most 2D+1, where D=floor(n/(32 log_2 n)); two explicit simple-encoding transfers are given. This is a standard corollary of the positivity theorem, not a size lower bound. Informal mathematics with AI-agent review; novelty and priority are unknown."
keywords:
  - weak rank principle
  - local distributions
  - conditional correlation
  - positivity
  - Boolean polynomials
  - sum of squares
  - certificate degree
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-12
url: "https://github.com/Quantyra/weak-rank-positivity-window"
